From 9a883c65b560c4aca490f2b199f5e28e67679e84 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jack <jack@local>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 13:12:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] docs(core): architecture v2 design reference

Design documentation for the combat core rewrite, written before
implementation. Covers module split, immutable state model, modifier
and status system, the pausable effect-stack resolver, data-driven
actions, snapshot persistence, and the animation director.

Includes a mapping of the twelve structural issues found in the v1
ECS proof of concept to their v2 answers, plus the test plan that
serves as the implementation contract for the next step.
